comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T05:47:24.265Z",codex-root,Official developer documentation and current home-assistant/core frontend WebSocket schemas were refreshed on 2026-08-07; four typed read-only contracts are confirmed on live Core 2026.7.4.
  "2026-08-07T06:35:28.055Z",codex-root,CodeRabbit review identified incomplete Feature-level delivery links. Added the omitted implementation test and documentation surface through pm update; immutable history remains append-only.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T05:47:24.265Z",codex-root,"Persist only contract names, schema fields, version booleans, counts, and validation status. Never persist themes, translations, entity identifiers, user data, endpoints, or credentials."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T05:47:24.265Z",codex-root,Dedicated frontend icon and translation contracts replace assumptions based on get_services descriptions and preserve compatibility with current Home Assistant localization behavior.
